  (gr_text "1  MATERIAL: Rogers RO4003C cores 0.203 / 0.508 / 0.203 mm, RO4450F prepreg 2 x 0.102 mm per opening. No FR-4." (at 205 16.48) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 677e451d-cdbd-4247-b822-833a0a32bb00) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "2  THICKNESS 1.50 mm +/-10 %. Outer Cu 1 oz finished (incl. plating), inner Cu 0.5 oz." (at 205 18.616) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp ce14953c-4e1e-40ca-952a-b2ea55059284) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "3  IMPEDANCE: F.Cu GCPW 50 ohm +/-5 % (w 0.40 / gap 0.15 mm, ref. In1). Fab may trim w by +/-0.02 mm. TDR coupon + report required." (at 205 20.752) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 7c9600fa-b78c-49aa-be3a-307c4c93b1ba) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "4  FINISH: NICKEL-FREE. Preferred EPAG (electroless Pd 0.1-0.3 um + immersion Au 0.05-0.1 um) or" (at 205 22.888) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 751d8fea-02f6-4f37-8a68-0db1784c100b) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "   electrolytic soft Au >= 0.5 um directly on Cu. Acceptable: immersion Ag (bond within 4 weeks) or ENEPIG" (at 205 25.024) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 1b8160fa-1157-4ff5-ac65-e6a67e66c5a5) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "   with high-P Ni (P >= 10 %) <= 1 um. DO NOT use ENIG or HASL." (at 205 27.16) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 0b43f260-6bb5-4f33-9a87-5e7a3ce00ddb) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "   WHY: ENIG carries 3-6 um electroless Ni(P), ferromagnetic at low P content or after heat cycles. At 10 mK" (at 205 29.296) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 07092261-e9a8-415e-90e6-fc2964074275) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "   next to a flux-based die it traps vortices, offsets the flux bias and adds loss/noise. HASL Sn/SnPb" (at 205 31.432) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp efb3e156-3eb4-4a05-9799-1d78d55bc3af) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "   is not wire-bondable. Au/Pd surfaces take Al-1%Si wedge bonds; Ag tarnishes (store dry, N2)." (at 205 33.568) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp f278e38c-13c2-4810-a16f-ff259d87318f) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "5  SOLDER MASK: green LPI, both sides, 10-25 um. NO mask in the die bond band (F.Mask openings) and on pads." (at 205 35.704) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 86a7a014-3dd1-4f89-8c15-ec77cdddf2ae) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "   Min. mask dam 0.10 mm. B.Mask opened 2.0 mm along the outer edge (GND contact to the Cu base)." (at 205 37.84) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 05f11f03-6473-4af7-b25a-68148b1efc1a) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "6  SILKSCREEN: white epoxy, top and bottom, never on pads or in the bond band." (at 205 39.976) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp d2037466-e164-4e09-aa91-e063acaafaa9) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "7  VIAS: through only, finished 0.20 mm (GND) and 0.25 mm (DC). Tented both sides. DC vias: non-functional inner pads removed." (at 205 42.112) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 206f0491-f690-4a44-ac13-44149e8784aa) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "8  DIE WINDOW: 10.30 x 10.30 mm routed through, +/-0.05 mm, corner reliefs R0.60 (router <= 1.2 mm)," (at 205 44.248) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp f8322066-9e7e-4864-991a-ccf72e5a8af2) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "   no burrs, wall NOT plated. Cu pull-back from the window: 0.10 mm top (bond pads), 0.30 mm inner/bottom." (at 205 46.384) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 11cfe8bc-3df8-4ea6-8953-aab058049c9e) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "9  OUTLINE 52.00 x 52.00 mm, R1.0 corners, routed +/-0.10 mm. Cu pull-back 0.30 mm from the outer edge on all layers." (at 205 48.52) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp df18bb1a-9c65-4d8f-b472-a18a750c9e66) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "10 HOLES per drill table: PTH +/-0.05 mm (vias +0.05/-0.10), NPTH dowel holes +/-0.03 mm." (at 205 50.656) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 04d33eef-d769-498c-9ad4-21b5ae491897) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "11 QUALITY: IPC-6012 class 2 (class 3 preferred), IPC-A-600 class 2. 100 % electrical test vs netlist." (at 205 52.792) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp bd37fdc3-3ce0-405f-9c31-8c0bd94dc15a) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "12 NON-MAGNETIC: no Ni underplate anywhere; report finish thicknesses (XRF) with the shipment." (at 205 54.928) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp bfb27b34-500f-420a-b668-9dd03a9bcdb8) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "13 CLEANLINESS: ionic contamination < 1.56 ug/cm2 NaCl eq.; bake 2 h at 120 C; vacuum pack." (at 205 57.064) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp c78f26ba-b752-4daf-9151-87987c12527d) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "14 DATA: Gerber X2 (fab/gerbers), Excellon PTH + NPTH (fab/drill), this drawing. Origin = board lower-left." (at 205 59.2) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 57777c78-9ea4-487a-9d06-824e75f38b90) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
  (gr_text "15 Not supplied (KiCad 7 cannot write them): ODB++, IPC-2581. IPC-D-356 netlist on request." (at 205 61.336) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 0fcd3805-30e1-484f-a385-916f0e3fd6cc) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) (thickness 0.18)) (justify left)))
